{"id":"signal","lemma":"signal","pos":"noun","rank":1056,"glosses":["signal"],"ipa":"/si.ɲal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Fr-signal.ogg/Fr-signal.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"signaux"},"formAudio":{"signaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-signaux.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il nous a donné le signal pour commencer.","en":"He gave us the signal to begin.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"for starters"]]},{"text":"Que signifient ces signaux ?","en":"What do these markings mean?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to signify, mean","l":"signifier"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Je lance un signal de détresse.","en":"I'm declaring an emergency.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to throw","l":"lancer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"distress"}]},{"text":"Elle lui a transmis des signaux contradictoires.","en":"She gave him mixed signals.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to transmit","l":"transmettre"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"contradictory","l":"contradictoire"}]},{"text":"Ne tirez pas jusqu'à ce que je vous en donne le signal.","en":"Don't fire until I give the word.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to / at"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"what"]]}]}